    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal darkness of the dungeons dragged the brave knight in golden armor into an endless maze of dangers. The gloomy corridors are full of treacherous traps, golden chests and terrible monsters hunting anyone who dares to enter the dungeon. But the main test is to calculate your actions, because the adventurer's steps are limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knightventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn\u2014based roguelike from above, where each level is a new dungeon that requires careful calculation of moves. You move through the cells, collect treasures, fight monsters and defuse traps, but you need to make it before you reach the limit of steps. Strategy and cunning decide whether you get to the next level or stay in the abyss forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited number of moves per level: plan each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system for upgrading armor and weapons between attempts.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eternal darkness of the dungeons dragged the brave knight in golden armor into an endless maze of dangers. The gloomy corridors are full of treacherous traps, golden chests and terrible monsters hunting anyone who dares to enter the dungeon. But the main test is to calculate your actions, because the adventurer's steps are limited.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knightventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn\u2014based roguelike from above, where each level is a new dungeon that requires careful calculation of moves. You move through the cells, collect treasures, fight monsters and defuse traps, but you need to make it before you reach the limit of steps. Strategy and cunning decide whether you get to the next level or stay in the abyss forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited number of moves per level: plan each move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters and traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system for upgrading armor and weapons between attempts.</p></li></ul>",
